<title>USA: PHLX listing of Millennium options delayed.</title>
<headline>PHLX listing of Millennium options delayed.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said its trading in options on Millennium Pharmaceutical shares will start on March 4 instead of February 28 as originally announced.</p>
<p>PHLX said any changes that might occur in opening strike prices would be announced later.</p>
<p>Earlier, PHLX said Millennium options would open with strikes of 15, 17-1/2 and 20, with expirations in March, April, May and August. Paul Dry &amp; Co is the specialist.</p>
<p>The stock rose 1/8 to 17-1/4 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk 312-408-8750))</p>
